  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP digital public goods for development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement will support UNDP to integrate digital public goods as a core component in its approach for supporting comprehensive digital transformation in countries, and raise additional donor funding for this work. UNDP&apos;s engagement with digital public goods is grounded in focus on democratic principles, transparency, borad inclusion and gender equality, which will be an integral focus on this agreement. The agreement will also fund UNDP&apos;s contribution of staff resources to the Digital Public Goods Alliance Secretariat, as part of UNDP becoming a co-host of the Alliance from January 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
